      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Likely not a bug, without steps to reproduce. Avatars which are available on the Windows platform only will be shown as fallbacks or impostors.\n\nSee: https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-impostors/\n\n@{6a7fdf29523ad16133f87813|full_name} Your Quest 2 also entered low memory mode almost immediately on launch, which will also prevent you from viewing much in detail to prevent crashing the app. The Quest 2 has only 6 GB memory and is hardware limited on how much it can display.\n\nThere's not much more that can be said, because the attached log file was with logging level set to \"Errors Only\" instead of \"Full\".",
